        "Content": "<ul><li> Mature Treeswith Laurel Hedge and Lawn </li><li> Tarmac Driveway </li><li> O.F.C.H </li><li> Patio </li><li> Covered Water Collection Tank </li><li> Stable and Paddock </li><li> Garden Shed </li><li> Outside Tap </li><li> Outside Lights </li><li> Approx. 4km from Ardrahan village</li></ul>"
